  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support sustainable tourism through safeguarding, rehabilitation, and promotion of the Agro-Cultural Landscape in Battir</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to supporting the economic and social development of the people of Battir Area by promoting agro-cultural tourism and enhancing agro-ecological production. By the end of the project period, the cultural landscape in the UNESCO World Heritage Property in Battir as well as the surrounding villages will be further safeguarded, especially their agricultural terraces and water resources to attract visitors and tourists in a sustainable manner and to increase the production of crop/vegetable varieties and brand them to benefit the local community.</narrative>
  </description>
